@␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Ю­␀@␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀rs485_init␀␀app_main␀␀␀␀␀␀Ђ?␀$tЙ␀$tIoѓ:НММ=␀␀aE␀␀А@8	@T8	@h8	@x8	@Њ8	@¤8	@ё8	@М8	@д8	@ш8	@9	@ 9	@89	@P9	@h9	@€9	@њ9	@ґ9	@М9	@д9	@␀:	@:	@(:	@<:	@P:	@h:	@Ђ:	@њ:	@apply_static_ip␀app_eth_init␀␀␀␀d␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀яяяяd␀␀␀ ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀app_mqtt_start␀␀app_mqtt_init␀␀␀app_config_factory_reset␀␀␀␀app_config_init␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀h_config_json␀␀␀app_web_start␀␀␀¬1	@␀␀␀h@␀␀␀␀@[	@␀␀␀р@␀␀␀␀P[	@␀␀␀Ж@␀␀␀␀X[	@␀␀␀N@␀␀␀␀h[	@␀␀␀@␀␀␀␀t[	@␀␀␀І@␀␀␀␀Ђ[	@␀␀␀Д@␀␀␀␀ђ[	@␀␀␀@␀␀␀␀[	@␀␀␀ћ@␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀яяя␀␀P␀␀Ђ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀app_log_init␀<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>JK-BMS Bridge вЂ“ Konfiguration</title>
<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light;
    --bg: #f3f6fb;
    --surface: #ffffff;
    --ink: #172235;
    --muted: #66758a;
    --line: #dce4ef;
    --accent: #2563eb;
    --accent-dark: #1d4ed8;
    --accent-soft: #eaf1ff;
    --good: #15803d;
    --bad: #b42318;
    --shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(26, 45, 78, .07);
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { min-height: 100%; background: var(--bg); }
  body {
    max-width: 920px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 30px 20px 48px;
    color: var(--ink);
    font: 15px/1.55 system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  }
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 28px 30px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    color: #fff;
    background: linear-gradient(125deg, #142d52 0%, #1e4f91 58%, #2877c7 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 34px rgba(24, 62, 115, .2);
  }
  .hero::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    width: 230px;
    height: 230px;
    right: -70px;
    top: -105px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 24px rgba(255,255,255,.045), 0 0 0 50px rgba(255,255,255,.035);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 5px;
    color: #c7ddff;
    font-size: .75rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: .14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  h1 { position: relative; z-index: 1; margin: 0; font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 4vw, 2.05rem); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
  .hero-copy { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 620px; margin: 10px 0 0; color: #e0ecff; }
  #meta {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 17px 0 0;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(9, 27, 54, .24);
    color: #f4f8ff;
    font-size: .82rem;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  form { margin: 0; }
  fieldset {
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 16px 0;
    padding: 22px 24px 18px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 15px;
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  legend {
    padding: 0 9px;
    color: #203858;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: -.01em;
  }
  label { display: block; margin: 13px 0; font-weight: 600; color: #34445b; }
  input[type="text"], input[type="password"] {
    display: block;
    width: min(100%, 470px);
    min-height: 43px;
    margin-top: 6px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border: 1px solid #c8d3e1;
    border-radius: 9px;
    outline: none;
    background: #fbfcff;
    color: var(--ink);
    font: inherit;
    font-weight: 450;
    transition: border-color .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease, background .15s ease;
  }
  input[type="text"]:focus, input[type="password"]:focus {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(37, 99, 235, .14);
  }
  input::placeholder { color: #9aa8ba; }
  input[type="checkbox"] {
    width: 17px;
    height: 17px;
    margin: 0 8px 0 0;
    accent-color: var(--accent);
    vertical-align: -3px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  label:has(input[type="checkbox"]) { font-weight: 550; }
  .hint { margin: 7px 0 4px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .86rem; font-weight: 400; }
  .off { display: none !important; }
  button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    min-height: 42px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    font: inherit;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(37, 99, 235, .15);
    transition: background .15s ease, transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease;
  }
  button:hover { background: var(--accent-dark); box-shadow: 0 5px 12px rgba(37, 99, 235, .2); }
  button:active { transform: translateY(1px); }
  button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid rgba(37, 99, 235, .28); outline-offset: 2px; }
  button:disabled { opacity: .55; cursor: wait; box-shadow: none; }
  #ourl_reset {
    border-color: #cbd5e1;
    background: #f8fafc;
    color: #334155;
    box-shadow: none;
  }
  #ourl_reset:hover { background: #eef2f7; }
  #msg, #omsg, #cmsg { margin-left: 7px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .ok { color: var(--good); font-weight: 700; }
  .err { color: var(--bad); font-weight: 700; }
  code {
    display: inline-block;
    max-width: 100%;
    padding: 3px 7px;
    border: 1px solid #e1e8f1;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #f4f7fb;
    color: #34445b;
    font: .88em/1.5 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    word-break: break-word;
  }
  #updinfo { font-weight: 700; }
  .save-row { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin: 20px 0 26px; }
  .save-row button { min-height: 48px; padding: 12px 20px; }
  .section-intro { margin: 0 0 14px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }
  .status-line { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
  .status-line code { flex: 0 1 auto; }
  #ostat { color: #334155; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    body { padding: 14px 12px 30px; }
    .hero { padding: 23px 20px; border-radius: 15px; }
    fieldset { padding: 18px 16px 14px; border-radius: 12px; }
    button { width: 100%; margin: 3px 0; }
    .save-row { align-items: stretch; }
    #msg, #omsg, #cmsg { display: block; margin: 6px 0 0; }
    .status-line { align-items: stretch; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    *, *::before, *::after { scroll-behavior: auto !important; transition: none !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">GerГ¤temanagement В· ESP32-P4</p>
  <h1>JK-BMS Bridge</h1>
  <p class="hero-copy">Netzwerk, MQTT-Verbindung und Firmware bequem konfigurieren.</p>
  <p id="meta">GerГ¤testatus wird geladen вЂ¦</p>
</header>

<form id="f">
  <fieldset>
    <legend>Web-OberflГ¤che</legend>
    <label>Neues Web-Passwort (leer = unverГ¤ndert)
      <input type="password" name="pw" autocomplete="new-password">
    </label>
    <label><input type="checkbox" name="pw_clear"> Vorhandenes Web-Passwort entfernen</label>
    <p class="hint">Ohne Passwort ist die WeboberflГ¤che im Netzwerk frei zugГ¤nglich.</p>
  </fieldset>

  <fieldset>
    <legend>Netzwerk (Ethernet)</legend>
    <label><input type="checkbox" id="dhcp" name="dhcp"> IP-Adresse per DHCP beziehen</label>
    <div id="staticfields">
      <label>IP-Adresse <input type="text" name="ip" maxlength="15" placeholder="192.168.1.50"></label>
      <label>Netzmaske <input type="text" name="mask" maxlength="15" placeholder="255.255.255.0"></label>
      <label>Gateway <input type="text" name="gw" maxlength="15" placeholder="192.168.1.1"></label>
      <label>DNS-Server <input type="text" name="dns" maxlength="15" placeholder="192.168.1.1"></label>
    </div>
    <p class="hint off" id="dnshint">Im DHCP-Modus dient dieser DNS-Server als zusГ¤tzlicher Fallback,
      falls der DHCP-Server keinen (brauchbaren) DNS-Lieferant ist.</p>
  </fieldset>

  <fieldset>
    <legend>MQTT</legend>
    <label>Broker-URI (mqtt://host:port)
      <input type="text" name="uri" maxlength="120" placeholder="mqtt://192.168.1.10:1883">
    </label>
    <label>Benutzername <input type="text" name="user" maxlength="63" autocomplete="off"></label>
    <label>MQTT-Passwort (leer = unverГ¤ndert)
      <input type="password" name="pass" autocomplete="new-password">
    </label>
    <label><input type="checkbox" name="pass_clear"> Vorhandenes MQTT-Passwort entfernen</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox" name="tls"> TLS verwenden (mqtts, eingebettetes CA-Zertifikat)</label>
    <p class="hint">Leere Broker-URI schaltet MQTT komplett aus (nur WeboberflГ¤che bleibt aktiv).</p>
  </fieldset>

  <fieldset>
    <legend>Diagnose</legend>
    <label><input type="checkbox" name="dbg"> RS485-Debug (Hexdump der Rohdaten im Log)</label>
    <p><button type="button" id="logbtn">GerГ¤telog Г¶ffnen (Terminal, neuer Tab)</button>
       <span class="hint">Zeigt die Konsolenausgaben der Firmware live im Browser
         (http://&lt;device-ip&gt;/log). Solange das Terminal pollt, wird die Logausgabe
         dorthin umgeleitet und das Loglevel ist dort dynamisch wГ¤hlbar; nach dem
         SchlieГџen lГ¤uft die serielle Konsole automatisch wieder weiter.</span></p>
  </fieldset>

  <div class="save-row">
    <button type="submit">Konfiguration speichern</button>
    <span class="hint">Das GerГ¤t startet anschlieГџend neu.</span>
    <span id="msg" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span>
  </div>
</form>

<fieldset>
  <legend>Firmware-Update</legend>
  <p class="section-intro">Firmware-Version prГјfen und Aktualisierungen kontrolliert installieren.</p>
  <p>Installierte Software: <code id="ver">вЂ“</code> aus Partition <code id="part">вЂ“</code></p>
  <p>Standard-Update-URL (Build-Zeit): <code id="ourl">вЂ“</code></p>
  <label>Manuelle Update-URL (leer = Standard-URL verwenden)
    <input type="text" id="otaurl" name="ota_url" maxlength="255" placeholder="https://example.org/jkbms_mqtt_poe_p4.bin" autocomplete="off">
  </label>
  <p><button type="button" id="ourl_reset">Manuelle URL zurГјcksetzen</button>
     <span class="hint">Leere manuelle URL = der Update-Button nutzt wieder die Standard-URL
       und der Update-Check fragt eine вЂћversionвЂњ-Datei daneben ab.</span></p>
  <p>Update-Check: <code id="updinfo" class="status">noch nicht geprГјft</code>
     <button type="button" id="cbtn" style="margin-left:8px">Jetzt prГјfen</button></p>
  <p><button type="button" id="obtn">Update von der aktiven URL installieren</button>
     <span id="omsg" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span></p>
  <p class="hint">Aktiv ist die manuelle URL, sonst die Standard-URL. Die PrГјfung lГ¤dt nur eine
     kleine вЂћversionвЂњ-Textdatei (regelmГ¤Гџig sowie per вЂћJetzt prГјfenвЂњ) und zeigt hier und Гјber
     MQTT (<code>&lt;prefix&gt;/device</code>) an, ob eine neuere Version verfГјgbar ist. Die neue
     Firmware bootet zunГ¤chst вЂћpending verifyвЂњ und wird erst nach dem ersten fehlerfreien
     BMS-Poll bestГ¤tigt; bootet sie nicht, rollt der Bootloader automatisch zurГјck.
     MQTT-Trigger (<code>&lt;prefix&gt;/ota</code>) funktionieren unabhГ¤ngig davon mit beliebigen URLs.</p>
  <p class="status-line"><strong>Installationsstatus</strong> <code id="ostat" class="status">idle</code></p>
  <p id="cmsg" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
</fieldset>

<script>
"use strict";
const $ = (id) => document.getElementById(id);
const f = document.forms.f;
const IPV4 = /^(\d{1,3}\.){3}\d{1,3}$/;
let cfg = null;

function show(id, cls, text) { const el = $(id); el.className = cls; el.textContent = text; }

function upd() {
  const dhcp = f.elements.dhcp.checked;
  $("staticfields").className = dhcp ? "off" : "";
  $("dnshint").className = dhcp ? "hint" : "hint off";
}

/* Text/class for the "Update-Check" line based on a version-state object
 * (from /config.json or /ota/version). */
function updInfoText(v) {
  if (v.checking) return "PrГјfung lГ¤uftвЂ¦";
  if (!v.checked) return v.error ? "PrГјfung fehlgeschlagen: " + v.error : "noch nicht geprГјft";
  if (v.available) return "UPDATE VERFГњGBAR: " + v.remote + " (installiert: " + v.installed + ")";
  return "aktuell" + (v.remote ? " (remote: " + v.remote + ")" : "");
}
function applyUpdInfo(v) {
  const t = updInfoText(v);
  if (v.checked && v.available) show("updinfo", "err", t);
  else if (v.checked) show("updinfo", "ok", t);
  else if (v.error) show("updinfo", "err", t);
  else show("updinfo", "", t);
}

f.elements.dhcp.addEventListener("change", upd);
f.elements.pw.addEventListener("input", () => {
  if (f.elements.pw.value) f.elements.pw_clear.checked = false;
});
f.elements.pass.addEventListener("input", () => {
  if (f.elements.pass.value) f.elements.pass_clear.checked = false;
});

f.addEventListener("submit", async (ev) => {
  ev.preventDefault();
  const q = new URLSearchParams();
  if (!f.elements.dhcp.checked) {
    const v4 = ["ip", "mask", "gw", "dns"].map((n) => f.elements[n].value.trim());
    if (v4.some((v) => !IPV4.test(v))) {
      show("msg", "err", "Statisch: alle vier Adressen im Format a.b.c.d angeben.");
      return;
    }
  }
  if (f.elements.pw_clear.checked) q.set("pw_clear", "on");
  if (f.elements.pw.value.trim()) q.set("pw", f.elements.pw.value.trim());
  ["ip", "mask", "gw", "dns", "uri", "user"].forEach((n) => q.set(n, f.elements[n].value.trim()));
  q.set("ota_url", $("otaurl").value.trim());
  if (f.elements.pass.value.trim()) q.set("pass", f.elements.pass.value.trim());
  if (f.elements.pass_clear.checked) q.set("pass_clear", "on");
  q.set("dhcp", f.elements.dhcp.checked ? "on" : "0");
  q.set("tls", f.elements.tls.checked ? "on" : "0");
  q.set("dbg", f.elements.dbg.checked ? "on" : "0");

  try {
    const r = await fetch("/save", { method: "POST", body: q });
    show("msg", r.ok ? "ok" : "err", await r.text());
  } catch (e) {
    show("msg", "err", "Anfrage fehlgeschlagen.");
  }
});

$("ourl_reset").addEventListener("click", () => {
  $("otaurl").value = "";
  show("cmsg", "ok", "Manuelle URL geleert - speichern, um zur Standard-URL zurГјckzukehren.");
});

document.getElementById("cbtn").addEventListener("click", async () => {
  const cbtn = document.getElementById("cbtn");
  cbtn.disabled = true;
  try {
    const r = await fetch("/ota/check", { method: "POST" });
    show("cmsg", r.ok ? "ok" : "err", await r.text());
    if (!r.ok) { cbtn.disabled = false; return; }
  } catch (e) {
    show("cmsg", "err", "Anfrage fehlgeschlagen.");
    cbtn.disabled = false;
    return;
  }
  show("cmsg", "ok", "PrГјfung lГ¤uft (dauert ein paar Sekunden)вЂ¦");
  /* Poll until the check completed (max ~45 s), then show the result. */
  for (let i = 0; i < 45; i++) {
    await new Promise((res) => setTimeout(res, 1000));
    try {
      const r = await fetch("/ota/version");
      if (!r.ok) throw new Error(r.status);
      const v = await r.json();
      applyUpdInfo(v);
      if (!v.checking) break;
    } catch (e) {
      /* device may reboot during the check */
    }
  }
  show("cmsg", "", "");
  cbtn.disabled = false;
});

$("obtn").addEventListener("click", async () => {
  if (!confirm("Firmware von der aktiven URL laden, installieren und neu starten?")) return;
  $("obtn").disabled = true;
  try {
    const r = await fetch("/ota/install", { method: "POST" });
    show("omsg", r.ok ? "ok" : "err", await r.text());
  } catch (e) {
    show("omsg", "err", "Anfrage fehlgeschlagen.");
  }
});

/* --- Device log terminal (opens /log in a new tab) ---------------- */
$("logbtn").addEventListener("click", () => {
  window.open("/log", "_blank", "noopener");
});

async function load() {
  try {
    const r = await fetch("/config.json");
    if (!r.ok) throw new Error(r.status);
    cfg = await r.json();
    f.elements.dhcp.checked = cfg.dhcp;
    f.elements.ip.value = cfg.ip;   f.elements.mask.value = cfg.mask;
    f.elements.gw.value = cfg.gw;   f.elements.dns.value = cfg.dns;
    f.elements.uri.value = cfg.uri; f.elements.user.value = cfg.user;
    f.elements.tls.checked = cfg.tls;
    f.elements.dbg.checked = cfg.dbg;
    $("otaurl").value = cfg.ota_url || "";
    $("ver").textContent = cfg.app_version;
    $("part").textContent = cfg.partition;
    $("ourl").textContent = cfg.ota_default_url ? cfg.ota_default_url : "(nicht gesetzt)";
    $("ostat").textContent = cfg.ota_status || "idle";
    applyUpdInfo({
      checked: cfg.sw_update_checked, available: cfg.sw_update_available,
      checking: cfg.checking, remote: cfg.sw_update_version || "",
      error: cfg.sw_update_error || "", installed: cfg.app_version || ""
    });
    $("meta").textContent = "Device-ID: jkbms-" + cfg.device_id +
      (cfg.pw_set ? " вЂ” Web-Passwort aktiv" : " вЂ” Web-OberflГ¤che ohne Passwort");
    upd();
  } catch (e) {
    $("meta").textContent = "Konfiguration konnte nicht geladen werden.";
  }
}

load();
setInterval(() => {
  fetch("/ota/status").then((r) => r.ok ? r.text() : Promise.reject())
    .then((t) => { $("ostat").textContent = t || "idle"; })
    .catch(() => { /* device may be rebooting */ });
}, 2000);
</script>
</body>
</html>
␀s@␀␀<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>JK-BMS вЂ“ GerГ¤telog</title>
<style>
  html, body { height: 100%; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: #0a101e;
    color: #cfe0fa;
    font: 13px/1.5 Consolas, "Cascadia Code", Menlo, "Courier New", monospace;
  }
  header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px 14px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    background: #101a30;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #22304d;
  }
  h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #eaf1ff; }
  label { color: #8fa8cf; font-size: 12px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  select, button {
    background: #1b2a47;
    color: #cfe0fa;
    border: 1px solid #2c4066;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    font: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  button:hover, select:hover { background: #233a63; }
  .stat { margin-left: auto; font-size: 12px; color: #8fa8cf; }
  .stat.live { color: #7ddc9a; }
  #term {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 12px 16px 40px;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-all;
    min-height: calc(100% - 120px);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <h1>GerГ¤telog <span id="app"></span></h1>
  <label>Loglevel
    <select id="lvl">
      <option value="0">none</option>
      <option value="1">error</option>
      <option value="2">warn</option>
      <option value="3">info</option>
      <option value="4">debug</option>
      <option value="5">verbose</option>
    </select>
  </label>
  <button id="clr" type="button">Leeren</button>
  <label><input type="checkbox" id="ascr" checked> Auto-Scroll</label>
  <span class="stat" id="stat">verbinde вЂ¦</span>
</header>
<pre id="term"></pre>
<script>
"use strict";
const $ = (id) => document.getElementById(id);
const term = $("term");
let since = 0;
let lines = 0;
let busy = false;

function append(l) {
  term.textContent += l + "\n";
  lines++;
}
function autoscroll() {
  if ($("ascr").checked) {
    window.scrollTo(0, document.body.scrollHeight);
  }
}
$("clr").addEventListener("click", () => {
  term.textContent = "";
  lines = 0;
  fetch("/log/data?clear=1&since=" + since, { cache: "no-store" })
    .then(poll).catch(() => {});
});
$("lvl").addEventListener("change", () => {
  fetch("/log/data?level=" + $("lvl").value + "&since=" + since, { cache: "no-store" })
    .then(poll).catch(() => {});
});

/* Polling loop: the HTTP server has a single worker task, so the endpoint
 * answers immediately instead of streaming (which would block /config.json
 * and friends while the terminal stays open). */
async function poll() {
  if (busy) return;
  busy = true;
  try {
    const r = await fetch("/log/data?since=" + since, { cache: "no-store" });
    if (!r.ok) throw new Error(r.status);
    const j = await r.json();
    if (j.reset) {
      term.textContent = "";
      lines = 0;
    }
    for (const l of (j.lines || [])) {
      append(l);
    }
    since = j.last;
    $("lvl").value = String(j.level);
    $("app").textContent = j.app ? "(" + j.app + ")" : "";
    const st = $("stat");
    if (j.viewer) {
      st.textContent = "live вЂ“ Logausgabe auf dieses Fenster umgeleitet";
      st.classList.add("live");
    } else {
      st.textContent = "historisch вЂ“ serielle Konsole aktiv";
      st.classList.remove("live");
    }
    autoscroll();
  } catch (e) {
    $("stat").textContent = "verbindung verloren вЂ¦";
    $("stat").classList.remove("live");
  } finally {
    busy = false;
  }
}
poll();
setInterval(poll, 600);
</script>
</body>
</html>
